{"title":"Goblin","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 5 Goblin that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (3.3% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/goblin-haft-binding\">Goblin Haft Binding</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/goblin\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=5\">Lv 5</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=6\">Lv 6 <span>102</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=8\">Lv 8 <span>129</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=10\">Lv 10 <span>6</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=12\">Lv 12 <span>32</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=13\">Lv 13 <span>16</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=14\">Lv 14 <span>3</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=5\" title=\"Pick level 5\"><td><b>5</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>20</td><td>5.1</td><td>250</td><td class=\"muted\">60 · 7.1 · 750</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=6\" title=\"Pick level 6\"><td><b>6</b></td><td>22</td><td>6.2</td><td>300</td><td class=\"muted\">66 · 8.7 · 900</td><td>102</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=8\" title=\"Pick level 8\"><td><b>8</b></td><td>26</td><td>8.9</td><td>400</td><td class=\"muted\">78 · 12.5 · 1,200</td><td>129</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=10\" title=\"Pick level 10\"><td><b>10</b></td><td>31</td><td>10</td><td>500</td><td class=\"muted\">93 · 14 · 1,500</td><td>6</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/goblin\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>12</b></td><td>37</td><td>11.1</td><td>600</td><td class=\"muted\">111 · 15.5 · 1,800</td><td>32</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=13\" title=\"Pick level 13\"><td><b>13</b></td><td>40</td><td>11.7</td><td>650</td><td class=\"muted\">120 · 16.4 · 1,950</td><td>16</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=14\" title=\"Pick level 14\"><td><b>14</b></td><td>43</td><td>12.2</td><td>700</td><td class=\"muted\">129 · 17.1 · 2,100</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 17 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 82 recorded drops, 1,176 total, 3–49 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×3–49</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stolen-smith-tool\" title=\"Stolen Smith Tool - in 6 of 17 looted corpses, 6 recorded drops, 6 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6ffbf1314f120baf6e8d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stolen Smith Tool</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"shaft-iron\" title=\"Shaft Iron - in 4 of 17 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 5 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/81185423ec7184650576.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shaft Iron</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 4 of 17 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 5 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1–2</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+10 more\">+10 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-small\" title=\"Stamina Potion Small - in 3 of 17 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7e73cfe258f353082838.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Small</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/6<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-small\" title=\"Health Potion Small - in 1 of 17 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/8bf96652c9d8d6a71818.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"en