 class=\"entity-chip-label\">Leather Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/17<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"scroll-fire-blast\" title=\"Scroll Fire Blast - in 1 of 17 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b66cd8cfb8dcdd17e1d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scroll Fire Blast</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/17<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link quest\" data-item=\"skark-pot-helm\" title=\"Skark Pot Helm - in 1 of 17 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop - Quest item: Skark\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/96242fae6c8bb8fa98d3.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"quest-tag\" title=\"Quest item\">Q</span><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Skark Pot Helm</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/17<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"iron-kryss\" title=\"Iron Kryss - in 1 of 17 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ff06530d73c8d6890e24.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Iron Kryss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/17<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Rustpick Mine</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 269</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-43\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(8)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/goblin-shama